description: Next.js 15 development standards for the 7Oz Espresso Cafe platform.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Next.js Standards

Framework

Next.js 15

App Router

React 19

TypeScript

---

# Routing

Always use App Router.

Never use Pages Router.

---

# Server Components

Prefer Server Components by default.

Only use Client Components when:

- State is required
- Browser APIs are required
- Event handlers are required
- Third-party libraries require them

Avoid unnecessary "use client".

---

# Metadata

Every route must define metadata.

Include:

- title
- description
- open graph
- twitter
- canonical URL

---

# Layout

Use nested layouts appropriately.

Avoid duplicated layouts.

---

# Loading

Every async route should support:

loading.tsx

---

# Error Handling

Every important route should support:

error.tsx

---

# Not Found

Implement:

not-found.tsx

---

# Images

Always use:

next/image

Never use plain img unless absolutely necessary.

---

# Fonts

Always use:

next/font

Never import fonts through CSS.

---

# Navigation

Use:

next/link

Never use anchor tags for internal navigation.

---

# Data Fetching

Prefer Server Components.

Use TanStack Query only when client caching is required.

---

# Environment Variables

Client

NEXT_PUBLIC_

Server

process.env

Never expose secrets to client.

---

# Caching

Understand cache behavior.

Explicitly configure cache when necessary.

Never assume default behavior.

---

# Goal

Use modern Next.js patterns.

Avoid legacy React patterns.